  "summary": "I’m a Full Stack Developer with over 10 years of experience designing, developing, and maintaining scalable web applications and enterprise solutions.\n\nMy expertise spans both front-end and back-end development, working with technologies such as JavaScript, React, Java, Spring Boot, PHP, Laravel, HTML, CSS, and SQL.\n\nThroughout my career, I’ve worked on building applications from the ground up, integrating RESTful APIs, automating business processes, optimizing database performance, and modernizing existing systems. I enjoy solving complex technical challenges and delivering reliable, efficient, and maintainable solutions.\n\nI’m passionate about continuous learning, writing clean code, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to turn business requirements into practical technical solutions.\n\nCore Skills:\n\n* Full Stack Web Development\n* RESTful API Development & System Integration\n* PHP, Laravel, Java & Spring Boot\n* JavaScript, React, HTML & CSS\n* SQL & Database Optimization\n* Business Process Automation\n* Troubleshooting & Performance Optimization\n* Agile Development & Team Collaboration\n\nAuthorized to work in the U.S. | Open to opportunities in the Chicago metropolitan area and remote positions across the U.S.\n\nI’m always open to connecting with fellow developers, technology professionals, and recruiters to explore new opportunities and build impactful software solutions.",
